{"server":"en","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-07_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-07","title":"Roar","storyCode":"3-7","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e1ad286cbb2fd0949c07c85c7a19b535876b49350885275ff37a7ed8448eaca2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十九关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"We've broken through the first defensive line!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What are the casters doing?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Even though there's only one enemy in the vanguard..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Why are they just watching her tear us apart?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hurry, hurry! Take her out!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Franka! You're getting out of range!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't... give you cover from here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Do I look that reckless to you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch your four o'clock!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Liskarm, it's time for your debut!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Be a sweetie and block the enemy's ranged attacks, won't you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Tsk..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Quick! Faster!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Focus down the one with the sword first!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Did we get her--?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't even think about it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"You call those attacks, or are you just throwing sticks and stones?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Woah!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Wh-where'd this one come from?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"I owe you one, Cap'n!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"My pleasure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"However, Franka, your task was to launch a feint attack."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Instead, you fought your way all the way here. You have a huge target over your head now. Is that fine with you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure is, after all, I have a trusty partner after all!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh... Gahh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Franka! You charged way too far ahead!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"See? She caught up to us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not used to this kind of stuff...! Why are you making me charge headlong into the enemy? I don't get it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"...Huh?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Curses..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"L.G.D. and Rhodes Island are working together!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"There's no way we can defend this place..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"We can't afford to hesitate. It's do or die. Everyone, chaaarge!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"The enemies are rushing straight at us!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Dieeeee!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"If you plan to resist, you leave me with no choice. Don't take it personally."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaaaaaaghhh!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam, you're... quite strong."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"That Reunion fellow... Not his lucky day."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"They've got some nerve to attack us like that..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"I feel bad for him."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"They should apologize to those who died unjustly."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Inspector!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm glad to see that you're all fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We've collapsed their flank! The next step is to launch our all-out assault."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Fine by me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Everything seems to be going smoothly."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"That probably won't last for much longer. The enemies have set up many obstacles, and are doing a good job of staying hidden."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, be prepared for a hard fight."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname}, make sure you scout things out thoroughly and protect your squads!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Everyone, let's go rescue Misha together!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["Liskarm"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["Hoshiguma"]}]}
